": "o(/ti"}, {"t": "δυοῖν", "o": 24, "k": "duoi=n"}, {"t": "ἡ", "o": 30, "k": "h("}, {"t": "δίψα", "o": 32, "k": "di/ya"}, {"t": "ἐπιθυμία", "o": 37, "k": "e)piqumi/a"}, {"t": "ποτοῦ", "o": 47, "k": "potou="}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 53, "k": "kai/"}]}, {"n": 31, "text": "τροφῆς, ἡ δὲ πεῖνα ἑνὸς μόνου, τροφῆς;", "tokens": [{"t": "τροφῆς", "o": 0, "k": "trofh=s"}, {"t": "ἡ", "o": 8, "k": "h("}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 10, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "πεῖνα", "o": 13, "k": "pei=na"}, {"t": "ἑνὸς", "o": 19, "k": "e(no/s"}, {"t": "μόνου", "o": 24, "k": "mo/nou"}, {"t": "τροφῆς", "o": 31, "k": "trofh=s"}]}, {"n": 32, "text": "Διὰ τί ἧττον καρτεροῦμεν διψῶντες ἢ πεινῶντες; ἢ", "tokens": [{"t": "Διὰ", "o": 0, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τί", "o": 4, "k": "ti/"}, {"t": "ἧττον", "o": 7, "k": "h(=tton"}, {"t": "καρτεροῦμεν", "o": 13, "k": "karterou=men"}, {"t": "διψῶντες", "o": 25, "k": "diyw=ntes"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 34, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "πεινῶντες", "o": 36, "k": "peinw=ntes"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 47, "k": "h)/"}]}, {"n": 33, "text": "διότι λυπούμεθα μᾶλλον; σημεῖον δὲ τῆς λύπης ἡ ἡδονὴ", "tokens": [{"t": "διότι", "o": 0, "k": "dio/ti"}, {"t": "λυπούμεθα", "o": 6, "k": "lupou/meqa"}, {"t": "μᾶλλον", "o": 16, "k": "ma=llon"}, {"t": "σημεῖον", "o": 24, "k": "shmei=on"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 32, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 35, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "λύπης", "o": 39, "k": "lu/phs"}, {"t": "ἡ", "o": 45, "k": "h("}, {"t": "ἡδονὴ", "o": 47, "k": "h(donh/"}]}, {"n": 34, "text": "σφοδροτέρα. εἶτα ὁ μὲν διψῶν δυοῖν ἐνδεής, τροφῆς τε καὶ", "tokens": [{"t": "σφοδροτέρα", "o": 0, "k": "sfodrote/ra"}, {"t": "εἶτα", "o": 12, "k": "ei)=ta"}, {"t": "ὁ", "o": 17, "k": "o("}, {"t": "μὲν", "o": 19, "k": "me/n"}, {"t": "διψῶν", "o": 23, "k": "diyw=n"}, {"t": "δυοῖν", "o": 29, "k": "duoi=n"}, {"t": "ἐνδεής", "o": 35, "k": "e)ndeh/s"}, {"t": "τροφῆς", "o": 43, "k": "trofh=s"}, {"t": "τε", "o": 50, "k": "te"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 53, "k": "kai/"}]}, {"n": 35, "text": "καταψύξεως (ἄμφω γὰρ ἔχει τὸ ποτόν), ὁ δὲ πεινῶν θατέρου", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "καταψύξεως", "o": 0, "k": "katayu/cews"}, {"t": "ἄμφω", "o": 11, "k": "a)/mfw"}, {"t": "γὰρ", "o": 17, "k": "ga/r"}, {"t": "ἔχει", "o": 21, "k": "e)/xei"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 26, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "ποτόν", "o": 29, "k": "poto/n"}, {"t": "ὁ", "o": 37, "k": "o("}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 39, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "πεινῶν", "o": 42, "k": "peinw=n"}, {"t": "θατέρου", "o": 49, "k": "qate/rou"}]}, {"n": 36, "text": "μόνον.", "tokens": [{"t": "μόνον", "o": 0, "k": "mo/non"}]}, {"n": 37, "text": "Διὰ τί οἱ κατὰ τὴν τῆς ἁφῆς ἢ γεύσεως ἡδονήν, οὗ", "tokens": [{"t": "Διὰ", "o": 0, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τί", "o": 4, "k": "ti/"}, {"t": "οἱ", "o": 7, "k": "oi("}, {"t": "κατὰ", "o": 10, "k": "kata/"}, {"t": "τὴν", "o": 15, "k": "th/n"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 19, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "ἁφῆς", "o": 23, "k": "a(fh=s"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 28, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "γεύσεως", "o": 30, "k": "geu/sews"}, {"t": "ἡδονήν", "o": 38, "k": "h(donh/n"}, {"t": "οὗ", "o": 46, "k": "ou(="}]}, {"n": 38, "text": "ἂν ὑπερβάλλωσιν, ἀκρατεῖς λέγονται; οἵ τε γὰρ περὶ τὰ", "tokens": [{"t": "ἂν", "o": 0, "k": "a)/n"}, {"t": "ὑπερβάλλωσιν", "o": 3, "k": "u(perba/llwsin"}, {"t": "ἀκρατεῖς", "o": 17, "k": "a)kratei=s"}, {"t": "λέγονται", "o": 26, "k": "le/gontai"}, {"t": "οἵ", "o": 36, "k": "oi(/"}, {"t": "τε", "o": 39, "k": "te"}, {"t": "γὰρ", "o": 42, "k": "ga/r"}, {"t": "περὶ", "o": 46, "k": "peri/"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 51, "k": "ta/"}]}], "english": {"text": "But in those who live an intemperate life the excretions become superabundant up to a certain point, when they cease from their accustomed mode of life, owing to the fact that much undigested matter is still present in them from their former manner of living; and, when this is melted, like a mass of snow, by the natural heat, the result is that violent fluxes take place. Why is it that we speak of men as incontinent in connexion with two only of the senses, namely, touch and taste? Is it because of the pleasures that result from these in us and in the other animals? Being then shared by the animals, they are held in least honour and so are regarded as the only pleasures deserving of reproach, or at any rate more so than any others. So we blame a man who is a slave to them and call him incontinent and intemperate, because he is a slave to the worst pleasures. Why are men called incontinent in respect only of their desires, although incontinence is possible also in anger? Is it because an incontinent man is one who acts in some way contrary to reason, and incontinence is a mode of life which is contrary to reason, and the desires are, generally speaking, contrary to reason? Feelings of anger, on the other hand, are in consonance with reason, not in the sense that reason prompts them, but in the sense that reason informs us of the insult or of the charge made against us. Why is it that we approve most of continence and temperance in the young and wealthy, and of justice in the poor? Is it because we feel most admiration if a man abstains from what he most desires, rather than from the contrary? Now a poor man desires easy circumstances, while a rich young man wants enjoyment. Why can men tolerate thirst less easily than hunger? Is it because thirst is more painful? A proof that it is so is the fact that there is more pleasure in drinking when one is thirsty than in eating when one is hungry. Now the contrary of what is more pleasant is more painful. Or is it because the heat whereby we live requires moisture more? Or is it because thirst is a desire of two things, namely, drink and food, but hunger is a desire of only one, namely, food? Why can we endure thirst less than hunger? Is it because the former causes us more pain? A proof of the pain it causes is the fact that the pleasure it gives is more intense. Further, he who is thirsty needs two things, nourishment and cooling, and drink provides both of these; but he who is hungry needs one of them only. Why are men called incontinent if they indulge to excess in the pleasures connected with touch and taste? (For", "notes": [], "markers": [{"kind": "section", "n": "2", "offset": 374}, {"kind": "section", "n": "3", "offset": 871}, {"kind": "section", "n": "4", "offset": 1391}, {"kind": "section", "n": "5", "offset": 1702}, {"kind": "section", "n": "6", "offset": 2172}, {"kind": "section", "n": "7", "offset": 2496}], "bekker": [{"n": 1, "offset": 0, "real": true}, {"n": 5, "offset": 342, "real": false}, {"n": 10, "offset": 769, "real": true}, {"n": 15, "offset": 1083, "real": false}, {"n": 20, "offset": 1391, "real": true}, {"n": 25, "offset": 1714, "real": false}, {"n": 30, "offset": 2041, "real": true}, {"n": 35, "offset": 2392, "real": true}]}}, {"id": "28:950a", "column": "950a", "chapterStarts": [{"chapter": "8", "beforeLine": 17, "wordIndex": 0, "engOffset": 1287, "bekker": "950a17–19"}], "greek": [{"n": 1, "text": "ἀφροδίσια ἀκόλαστοι, οἵ τε περὶ τὰς τῆς τροφῆς ἀπολαύσεις.", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "ἀφροδίσια", "o": 0, "k": "a)frodi/sia"}, {"t": "ἀκόλαστοι", "o": 10, "k": "a)ko/lastoi"}, {"t": "οἵ", "o": 21, "k": "oi(/"}, {"t": "τε", "o": 24, "k": "te"}, {"t": "περὶ", "o": 27, "k": "peri/"}, {"t": "τὰς", "o": 32, "k": "ta/s"}, {"t": "τῆς", "o": 36, "k": "th=s"}, {"t": "τροφῆς", "o": 40, "k": "trofh=s"}, {"t": "ἀπολαύσεις", "o": 47, "k": "a)polau/seis"}]}, {"n": 2, "text": "τῶν δὲ κατὰ τὴν τροφὴν ἀπ' ἐνίων μὲν ἐν τῇ γλώττῃ", "tokens": [{"t": "τῶν", "o": 0, "k": "tw=n"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 4, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "κατὰ", "o": 7, "k": "kata/"}, {"t": "τὴν", "o": 12, "k": "th/n"}, {"t": "τροφὴν", "o": 16, "k": "trofh/n"}, {"t": "ἀπ'", "o": 23, "k": "a)p'"}, {"t": "ἐνίων", "o": 27, "k": "e)ni/wn"}, {"t": "μὲν", "o": 33, "k": "me/n"}, {"t": "ἐν", "o": 37, "k": "e)n"}, {"t": "τῇ", "o": 40, "k": "th=|"}, {"t": "γλώττῃ", "o": 43, "k": "glw/tth|"}]}, {"n": 3, "text": "τὸ ἡδύ, ἀπ' ἐνίων δὲ ἐν τῷ λάρυγγι, διὸ καὶ Φιλόξενος γεράνου", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "τὸ", "o": 0, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "ἡδύ", "o": 3, "k": "h(du/"}, {"t": "ἀπ'", "o": 8, "k": "a)p'"}, {"t": "ἐνίων", "o": 12, "k": "e)ni/wn"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 18, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "ἐν", "o": 21, "k": "e)n"}, {"t": "τῷ", "o": 24, "k": "tw=|"}, {"t": "λάρυγγι", "o": 27, "k": "la/ruggi"}, {"t": "διὸ", "o": 36, "k": "dio/"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 40, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "Φιλόξενος", "o": 44, "k": "filo/cenos"}, {"t": "γεράνου", "o": 54, "k": "gera/nou"}]}, {"n": 4, "text": "φάρυγγα εὔχετο ἔχειν. οἱ δὲ κατὰ τὴν ὄψιν καὶ τὴν", "tokens": [{"t": "φάρυγγα", "o": 0, "k": "fa/rugga"}, {"t": "εὔχετο", "o": 8, "k": "eu)/xeto"}, {"t": "ἔχειν", "o": 15, "k": "e)/xein"}, {"t": "οἱ", "o": 22, "k": "oi("}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 25, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "κατὰ", "o": 28, "k": "kata/"}, {"t": "τὴν", "o": 33, "k": "th/n"}, {"t": "ὄψιν", "o": 37, "k": "o)/yin"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 42, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "τὴν", "o": 46, "k": "th/n"}]}, {"n": 5, "text": "ἀκοὴν οὐκέτι. ἢ διὰ τὸ τὰς ἀπὸ τούτων γινομένας ἡδονὰς", "tokens": [{"t": "ἀκοὴν", "o": 0, "k": "a)koh/n"}, {"t": "οὐκέτι", "o": 6, "k": "ou)ke/ti"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 14, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "διὰ", "o": 16, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 20, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "τὰς", "o": 23, "k": "ta/s"}, {"t": "ἀπὸ", "o": 27, "k": "a)po/"}, {"t": "τούτων", "o": 31, "k": "tou/twn"}, {"t": "γινομένας", "o": 38, "k": "ginome/nas"}, {"t": "ἡδονὰς", "o": 48, "k": "h(dona/s"}]}, {"n": 6, "text": "κοινὰς εἶναι ἡμῖν καὶ τοῖς ἄλλοις ζῴοις; ἅτε οὖν οὖσαι κοιναὶ", "tokens": [{"t": "κοινὰς", "o": 0, "k": "koina/s"}, {"t": "εἶναι", "o": 7, "k": "ei)=nai"}, {"t": "ἡμῖν", "o": 13, "k": "h(mi=n"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 18, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "τοῖς", "o": 22, "k": "toi=s"}, {"t": "ἄλλοις", "o": 27, "k": "a)/llois"}, {"t": "ζῴοις", "o": 34, "k": "zw/|ois"}, {"t": "ἅτε", "o": 41, "k": "a(/te"}, {"t": "οὖν", "o": 45, "k": "ou)=n"}, {"t": "οὖσαι", "o": 49, "k": "ou)=sai"}, {"t": "κοιναὶ", "o": 55, "k": "koinai/"}]}, {"n": 7, "text": "ἀτιμόταταί εἰσι καὶ μάλιστα ἢ μόναι ἐπονείδιστοι, ὥστε τὸν", "tokens": [{"t": "ἀτιμόταταί", "o": 0, "k": "a)timo/tatai"}, {"t": "εἰσι", "o": 11, "k": "ei)si"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 16, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "μάλιστα", "o": 20, "k": "ma/lista"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 28, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "μόναι", "o": 30, "k": "mo/nai"}, {"t": "ἐπονείδιστοι", "o": 36, "k": "e)ponei/distoi"}, {"t": "ὥστε", "o": 50, "k": "w(/ste"}, {"t": "τὸν", "o": 55, "k": "to/n"}]}, {"n": 8, "text": "ὑπὸ τούτων ἡττώμενον ψέγομεν καὶ ἀκρατῆ καὶ ἀκόλαστον", "tokens": [{"t": "ὑπὸ", "o": 0, "k": "u(po/"}, {"t": "τούτων", "o": 4, "k": "tou/twn"}, {"t": "ἡττώμενον", "o": 11, "k": "h(ttw/menon"}, {"t": "ψέγομεν", "o": 21, "k": "ye/gomen"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 29, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ἀκρατῆ", "o": 33, "k": "a)krath="}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 40, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ἀκόλαστον", "o": 44, "k": "a)ko/laston"}]}, {"n": 9, "text": "λέγομεν διὰ τὸ ὑπὸ τῶν χειρίστων ἡδονῶν ἡττᾶσθαι. οὐσῶν", "tokens": [{"t": "λέγομεν", "o": 0, "k": "le/gomen"}, {"t": "διὰ", "o": 8, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τὸ", "o": 12, "k": "to/"}, {"t": "ὑπὸ", "o": 15, "k": "u(po/"}, {"t": "τῶν", "o": 19, "k": "tw=n"}, {"t": "χειρίστων", "o": 23, "k": "xeiri/stwn"}, {"t": "ἡδονῶν", "o": 33, "k": "h(donw=n"}, {"t": "ἡττᾶσθαι", "o": 40, "k": "h(tta=sqai"}, {"t": "οὐσῶν", "o": 50, "k": "ou)sw=n"}]}, {"n": 10, "text": "δὲ τῶν αἰσθήσεων πέντε, τά τε ἄλλα ζῷα ἀπὸ δύο μόνων", "tokens": [{"t": "δὲ", "o": 0, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "τῶν", "o": 3, "k": "tw=n"}, {"t": "αἰσθήσεων", "o": 7, "k": "ai)sqh/sewn"}, {"t": "πέντε", "o": 17, "k": "pe/nte"}, {"t": "τά", "o": 24, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "τε", "o": 27, "k": "te"}, {"t": "ἄλλα", "o": 30, "k": "a)/lla"}, {"t": "ζῷα", "o": 35, "k": "zw=|a"}, {"t": "ἀπὸ", "o": 39, "k": "a)po/"}, {"t": "δύο", "o": 43, "k": "du/o"}, {"t": "μόνων", "o": 47, "k": "mo/nwn"}]}, {"n": 11, "text": "τῶν προειρημένων ἥδεται, κατὰ δὲ τὰς ἄλλας ἢ ὅλως οὐχ", "tokens": [{"t": "τῶν", "o": 0, "k": "tw=n"}, {"t": "προειρημένων", "o": 4, "k": "proeirhme/nwn"}, {"t": "ἥδεται", "o": 17, "k": "h(/detai"}, {"t": "κατὰ", "o": 25, "k": "kata/"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 30, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "τὰς", "o": 33, "k": "ta/s"}, {"t": "ἄλλας", "o": 37, "k": "a)/llas"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 43, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "ὅλως", "o": 45, "k": "o(/lws"}, {"t": "οὐχ", "o": 50, "k": "ou)x"}]}, {"n": 12, "text": "ἥδεται ἢ κατὰ συμβεβηκὸς τοῦτο πάσχει. ὁρῶν μὲν γὰρ ὁ", "tokens": [{"t": "ἥδεται", "o": 0, "k": "h(/detai"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 7, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "κατὰ", "o": 9, "k": "kata/"}, {"t": "συμβεβηκὸς", "o": 14, "k": "sumbebhko/s"}, {"t": "τοῦτο", "o": 25, "k": "tou=to"}, {"t": "πάσχει", "o": 31, "k": "pa/sxei"}, {"t": "ὁρῶν", "o": 39, "k": "o(rw=n"}, {"t": "μὲν", "o": 44, "k": "me/n"}, {"t": "γὰρ", "o": 48, "k": "ga/r"}, {"t": "ὁ", "o": 52, "k": "o("}]}, {"n": 13, "text": "ὁρῶν, ἢ καὶ ὀσφραινόμενος, χαίρει ὅτι ἀπολαύει· καὶ ὅταν", "tokens": [{"t": "ὁρῶν", "o": 0, "k": "o(rw=n"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 6, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 8, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ὀσφραινόμενος", "o": 12, "k": "o)sfraino/menos"}, {"t": "χαίρει", "o": 27, "k": "xai/rei"}, {"t": "ὅτι", "o": 34, "k": "o(/ti"}, {"t": "ἀπολαύει", "o": 38, "k": "a)polau/ei"}, {"t": "καὶ", "o": 48, "k": "kai/"}, {"t": "ὅταν", "o": 52, "k": "o(/tan"}]}, {"n": 14, "text": "πληρωθῇ, οὐδὲ τὰ τοιαῦτα ἡδέα αὐτῷ, ὥσπερ οὐδὲ ἡμῖν ἡ τοῦ", "tokens": [{"t": "πληρωθῇ", "o": 0, "k": "plhrwqh=|"}, {"t": "οὐδὲ", "o": 9, "k": "ou)de/"}, {"t": "τὰ", "o": 14, "k": "ta/"}, {"t": "τοιαῦτα", "o": 17, "k": "toiau=ta"}, {"t": "ἡδέα", "o": 25, "k": "h(de/a"}, {"t": "αὐτῷ", "o": 30, "k": "au)tw=|"}, {"t": "ὥσπερ", "o": 36, "k": "w(/sper"}, {"t": "οὐδὲ", "o": 42, "k": "ou)de/"}, {"t": "ἡμῖν", "o": 47, "k": "h(mi=n"}, {"t": "ἡ", "o": 52, "k": "h("}, {"t": "τοῦ", "o": 54, "k": "tou="}]}, {"n": 15, "text": "ταρίχου ὀδμή, ὅταν ἄδην ἔχωμεν τοῦ φαγεῖν. ὅταν δὲ ἐνδεεῖς", "joined": true, "tokens": [{"t": "ταρίχου", "o": 0, "k": "tari/xou"}, {"t": "ὀδμή", "o": 8, "k": "o)dmh/"}, {"t": "ὅταν", "o": 14, "k": "o(/tan"}, {"t": "ἄδην", "o": 19, "k": "a)/dhn"}, {"t": "ἔχωμεν", "o": 24, "k": "e)/xwmen"}, {"t": "τοῦ", "o": 31, "k": "tou="}, {"t": "φαγεῖν", "o": 35, "k": "fagei=n"}, {"t": "ὅταν", "o": 43, "k": "o(/tan"}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 48, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "ἐνδεεῖς", "o": 51, "k": "e)ndeei=s"}]}, {"n": 16, "text": "ὦμεν, ἡδέα. ἡ δὲ τοῦ ῥόδου ἀεὶ ἡδεῖα.", "tokens": [{"t": "ὦμεν", "o": 0, "k": "w)=men"}, {"t": "ἡδέα", "o": 6, "k": "h(de/a"}, {"t": "ἡ", "o": 12, "k": "h("}, {"t": "δὲ", "o": 14, "k": "de/"}, {"t": "τοῦ", "o": 17, "k": "tou="}, {"t": "ῥόδου", "o": 21, "k": "r(o/dou"}, {"t": "ἀεὶ", "o": 27, "k": "a)ei/"}, {"t": "ἡδεῖα", "o": 31, "k": "h(dei=a"}]}, {"n": 17, "text": "Διὰ τί ἧττον κατέχουσι τὸν γέλωτα παρόντων τῶν", "tokens": [{"t": "Διὰ", "o": 0, "k": "dia/"}, {"t": "τί", "o": 4, "k": "ti/"}, {"t": "ἧττον", "o": 7, "k": "h(=tton"}, {"t": "κατέχουσι", "o": 13, "k": "kate/xousi"}, {"t": "τὸν", "o": 23, "k": "to/n"}, {"t": "γέλωτα", "o": 27, "k": "ge/lwta"}, {"t": "παρόντων", "o": 34, "k": "paro/ntwn"}, {"t": "τῶν", "o": 43, "k": "tw=n"}]}, {"n": 18, "text": "γνωρίμων; ἢ ὅταν σφόδρα ἐξηρτημένον ᾖ τι, εὐκίνητόν ἐστιν;", "tokens": [{"t": "γνωρίμων", "o": 0, "k": "gnwri/mwn"}, {"t": "ἢ", "o": 10, "k": "h)/"}, {"t": "ὅταν", "o": 12, "k": "o(/tan"}, {"t": "σφόδρα", "o": 17, "k": "sfo/dra"}, {"t": "ἐξηρτημένον", "o": 24, "k": "e)chrthme/non"}, {"t": "ᾖ", "o": 36, "k": "h)=|"}, {"t": "τι", "o": 38, "k": "ti"}, {"t": "εὐκίνητόν", "o": 42, "k": "eu)ki/nhton"}, {"t": "ἐστιν", "o": 52, "k": "e)stin"}]}, {"n": 19, "text": "ἡ δ' εὔνοια εἰπεῖν μᾶλλον γελοῖον, ὥστε κινεῖ.", "tokens": [{"t": "ἡ", "o": 0, "k": "h("}, {"t": "δ'", "o": 2, "k": "d'"}, {"t": "εὔνοια", "o": 5, "k": "eu)/noia"}, {"t": "εἰπεῖν", "o": 12, "k": "ei)pei=n"}, {"t": "μᾶλλον", "o": 19, "k": "ma=llon"}, {"t": "γελοῖον", "o": 26, "k": "geloi=on"}, {"t": "ὥστε", "o": 35, "k": "w(/ste"}, {"t": "κινεῖ", "o": 40, "k": "kinei="}]}], "english": {"text": "those who are intemperate in sexual intercourse and the enjoyments of eating and drinking are called incontinent; and in the joys of eating and drinking the pleasure is partly in the tongue and partly in the throat; hence Philoxenus longed for the throat of a crane.) And why is the term incontinent never extended to the pleasures of sight and hearing? Is it because the pleasures of touch and taste are common to us and the other animals? Being, then, shared by the animals they are held in least honour and so are regarded as the only pleasures deserving of reproach, or at any rate more so than any others. So we blame a man who is a slave to them and call him incontinent and intemperate, because he is a slave to the worst pleasures. Now the senses being five in number, the other animals find pleasure only in the two already mentioned; in the others they find no pleasure, or, if they do, it is only incidentally. For the lion rejoices when he sees or scents his prey, because he is going to enjoy it; and when he has satisfied his hunger, such things do not please him, just as the smell of dried fish gives us no pleasure when we have eaten our fill of it, though, when we wanted to partake of it, it was pleasant. The scent of the rose, on the other hand, is always pleasant. Why are men less able to restrain their laughter in the presence of friends? Is it because, when anything is especially elated, it is easily set in motion? Now benevolence causes elation, so that laughter more readily moves us.", "notes": [], "markers": [{"kind": "section", "n": "8", "offset": 1287}], "bekker": [{"n": 1, "offset": 0, "real": true}, {"n": 5, "offset": 354, "real": true}, {"n": 10, "offset": 761, "real": true}, {"n": 15, "offset": 1111, "real": true}]}}]}